<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1613) <span class="when">Oct 15, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Paperwork that is held.</b> A <code>source_info.txt</code> line can say <code>Hold:</code> and why: written down but not trusted yet. Its shot isn&#8217;t pulled (&#8220;Held: paperwork to check&#8221;), Shots on Disk shows it as Held, and Release Hold takes the hold off once it is checked.</li>
<li><b>Fixed:</b> in the pipeline&#8217;s layout the Shots folder kept the last sequence&#8217;s folder (a RAI cut showed <code>03_SHOTS/BOU</code>). A sequence&#8217;s own folder now follows the sequence the names say.</li>
